json5/number
description: Number in the JSON spelling or one of the eigen JSON5 ones
- >
  A JSON5 number is written in the JSON spelling or one of the eigen JSON5 ones - and ANY of
  them may carry an explicit sign, the plus included (JSON allows only the minus, and only on
  its decimal). See the subchapters below for the concretes:
- !!<format: text/x-json5> |
  42   -0.5   .5   42.   0x2A   +1   Infinity   NaN
- *..:..:..:07-json_code:01-json_scalar:01-json_number
- *: 01-json5_eigen_decimal
- *: 02-json5_hexadecimal
- *: 03-json5_infinity
- *: 04-json5_nan
